WEBVTT

01:40.190 --> 01:42.950
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.229 --> 01:45.979
[Episode 9]

01:47.979 --> 01:49.150
Are you a god?

01:51.310 --> 01:52.240
I am a demon.

01:55.170 --> 01:56.390
Gods aren't the only ones

01:56.390 --> 01:58.140
who can grant your wish.

01:59.590 --> 02:00.740
Demons can do it too.

02:04.080 --> 02:05.680
There must be a price, right?

02:07.630 --> 02:08.419
Of course.

02:15.750 --> 02:16.750
I'm willing.

02:17.490 --> 02:18.980
Aren't you going to ask

02:20.500 --> 02:21.940
what the price is?

02:22.950 --> 02:24.350
I'm willing

02:26.300 --> 02:27.430
no matter the price.

03:01.990 --> 03:03.080
God,

03:03.080 --> 03:03.880
Bodhisattva,

03:04.230 --> 03:05.760
I wish for my illness to disappear,

03:05.760 --> 03:07.220
for me to become stronger.

03:13.550 --> 03:15.280
Let me help my sister

03:17.630 --> 03:20.290
so that she won't have to carry the burden alone.

03:21.000 --> 03:22.050
May my sister

03:23.420 --> 03:25.360
be a happy, free,

03:26.910 --> 03:28.450
and unrestrained woman.

03:31.250 --> 03:32.860
May I no longer be a bystander

03:34.870 --> 03:36.530
and instead share the burden.

03:38.800 --> 03:39.550
Look.

03:39.790 --> 03:42.140
His wish was so strong.

03:42.829 --> 03:45.020
He was sick,

03:46.540 --> 03:48.220
but he was determined.

03:48.850 --> 03:50.660
Everything he did

03:51.470 --> 03:54.110
was just to live on

03:54.590 --> 03:55.970
to share your burden

03:57.750 --> 03:59.400
and give you freedom.

04:00.700 --> 04:02.030
But you...

04:04.620 --> 04:06.180
You suspected him

04:06.910 --> 04:08.040
and humiliated him.

04:08.510 --> 04:11.520
He wanted to take the bow and arrow to share your burden.

04:11.520 --> 04:12.720
But in the end,

04:13.180 --> 04:15.720
he died under your bow.

04:17.089 --> 04:18.570
Do you deserve

04:20.019 --> 04:22.160
being called his sister?

04:24.790 --> 04:26.230
Shut up!

04:35.320 --> 04:36.640
You want to kill me?

04:38.650 --> 04:39.770
Just like

04:40.030 --> 04:41.909
how you killed your brother?

04:48.050 --> 04:49.470
Just let go.

04:55.880 --> 04:57.790
But what's the use of killing me?

04:59.030 --> 05:00.760
You're just venting your anger

05:01.090 --> 05:02.810
and deceiving yourself.

05:04.470 --> 05:05.670
It was I

05:06.110 --> 05:08.350
who helped him realize his wish,

05:09.470 --> 05:10.510
while you

05:11.360 --> 05:14.050
kept saying you were acting for his own good,

05:15.210 --> 05:17.690
but you made him suffer so much.

05:20.310 --> 05:21.910
He would rather be a demon

05:22.850 --> 05:24.160
than be a human.

05:25.880 --> 05:26.890
Pei Sijing,

05:29.070 --> 05:30.610
your arrow

05:32.280 --> 05:34.030
shouldn't point at me.

05:36.310 --> 05:38.409
It should point at yourself.

05:46.530 --> 05:48.650
A heartless person

05:49.350 --> 05:50.840
also has tears?

05:53.370 --> 05:55.909
Does Pei Siheng know you cried for him?

05:56.440 --> 05:58.840
Have you ever felt guilty

06:00.570 --> 06:02.700
in the days and nights after his death?

06:05.350 --> 06:07.690
Have you ever,

06:07.720 --> 06:09.150
for even a moment,

06:10.280 --> 06:12.380
truly understood him?

06:16.710 --> 06:18.240
Until his death,

06:19.390 --> 06:21.950
the last words you left for him were...

06:23.790 --> 06:26.110
You've committed countless sins.

06:26.700 --> 06:28.010
You are unforgivable.

06:40.080 --> 06:41.690
I was wrong.

06:42.990 --> 06:44.440
Actually,

06:44.909 --> 06:46.830
you feel guilty too.

06:47.920 --> 06:49.360
You want to

06:50.210 --> 06:52.620
personally apologize to Heng,

06:53.380 --> 06:54.300
right?

06:55.930 --> 06:56.770
Yes.

06:59.120 --> 07:01.020
I owe him this.

07:06.270 --> 07:08.270
I can take you to Heng

07:09.790 --> 07:11.590
and let you apologize

07:12.100 --> 07:13.440
in person.

07:16.310 --> 07:17.500
Pei Sijing,

07:18.880 --> 07:20.000
are you willing?

07:21.020 --> 07:22.020
Sister Pei!

07:22.310 --> 07:24.100
Sister Pei, don't trust him!

07:24.120 --> 07:25.920
Sister Pei, let me in!

07:25.940 --> 07:27.170
Sister Pei!

07:40.950 --> 07:42.090
Are you willing?

07:43.780 --> 07:45.120
Sister Pei!

07:45.500 --> 07:46.540
Sister Pei!

07:47.500 --> 07:48.820
How?

07:49.030 --> 07:50.460
How do I open this?

07:50.490 --> 07:51.490
How do I open this?

07:53.590 --> 07:54.390
I...

07:55.960 --> 07:57.340
am willing.

09:22.140 --> 09:28.150
♫Someday I'll return to my old hometown♫

09:28.990 --> 09:35.040
♫Wearing old clothes but with eyes shining bright♫

09:35.760 --> 09:37.770
♫Holding brilliance in the right hand♫

09:37.860 --> 09:39.740
♫Biting down on all panic♫

09:39.800 --> 09:41.230
♫Wiping away frost with the left hand♫

09:41.290 --> 09:43.120
♫I finally look up♫

09:43.170 --> 09:46.020
♫You're in front of me♫

09:43.470 --> 09:44.510
Sister Pei!

10:20.720 --> 10:22.700
I fulfilled your wish,

10:22.800 --> 10:25.040
but you repaid me with betrayal.

10:25.070 --> 10:25.950
Sister Pei.

10:25.980 --> 10:27.610
Don't listen to his nonsense.

10:27.610 --> 10:29.790
Your brother's nature is pure and kind.

10:29.790 --> 10:31.690
He must have been tricked by this weasel

10:31.690 --> 10:33.070
and that's why he became a demon.

10:33.070 --> 10:34.700
He is the culprit.

11:25.910 --> 11:26.710
Sister.

11:28.540 --> 11:30.310
Why didn't you come to see me?

11:31.100 --> 11:33.230
You turned me into this.

11:38.330 --> 11:39.250
Sister.

11:41.940 --> 11:43.100
I missed you.

11:51.830 --> 11:53.150
Nonsense.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.910
If you really hate your sister,

11:54.930 --> 11:57.080
you wouldn't want her forgiveness.

12:00.130 --> 12:01.970
I'm indeed sinful

12:02.120 --> 12:03.320
and unforgivable.

12:03.870 --> 12:05.100
But Sister,

12:05.390 --> 12:06.780
I know I was wrong

12:07.240 --> 12:09.650
♫Turns out I'm a wanderer♫

12:09.760 --> 12:12.750
♫And you're a song of reluctant parting♫

12:12.760 --> 12:15.770
♫I'm a black-and-white wound♫

12:14.290 --> 12:15.580
But she still...

12:15.830 --> 12:18.380
♫You're the vibrant red color♫

12:16.680 --> 12:18.950
personally killed her own brother.

12:18.450 --> 12:21.320
♫How can I not remember♫

12:21.390 --> 12:23.960
♫You're always by my side♫

12:22.150 --> 12:23.750
She never asked him why

12:24.000 --> 12:25.790
♫Like wind surrounding flowers♫

12:25.670 --> 12:27.600
or showed any pity.

12:25.910 --> 12:34.010
♫Guarding the memories, never fading away♫

12:29.660 --> 12:31.290
Her actions were swift

12:33.480 --> 12:35.110
and her heart was firm.

12:37.830 --> 12:39.240
You said she has no heart.

12:39.790 --> 12:41.980
But do you think Sister Pei is happy?

12:42.000 --> 12:44.950
She lives in pain and self-blame every day.

12:45.730 --> 12:46.880
It's fake.

12:47.470 --> 12:49.270
It's merely to ease

12:49.270 --> 12:50.080
her conscience.

12:50.080 --> 12:52.030
I don't know what's fake.

12:52.110 --> 12:54.510
I only know you both don't say what you mean.

12:54.770 --> 12:56.940
You always call me a child,

12:56.970 --> 12:59.210
but even I am more honest than you.

12:59.320 --> 13:00.030
You adults

13:00.030 --> 13:01.950
easily say hurtful words,

13:01.950 --> 13:04.020
but you hide your love in your heart.

13:04.130 --> 13:05.530
Instead of being insincere,

13:05.530 --> 13:07.910
the truth is what you should say,

13:07.950 --> 13:08.750
right?

13:12.270 --> 13:14.620
Mother, I don't understand.

13:14.710 --> 13:16.310
Bai Jiu, you're still young.

13:16.550 --> 13:18.350
Of course you don't understand.

13:18.830 --> 13:20.700
But in this world,

13:20.830 --> 13:22.190
love and hate coexist.

13:23.230 --> 13:25.310
Often, just a slight difference in thought

13:25.310 --> 13:26.970
can produce hatred from love,

13:27.310 --> 13:28.710
and become an obsession.

13:29.830 --> 13:31.580
This obsession

13:31.820 --> 13:33.270
then becomes hatred.

13:34.750 --> 13:36.290
This hatred

13:36.480 --> 13:38.070
contains

13:39.520 --> 13:41.100
deep love.

13:43.050 --> 13:44.080
Heng.

13:49.410 --> 13:50.910
Do you hate me?

13:57.240 --> 13:58.750
I hate myself more.

14:00.860 --> 14:01.870
Ridiculous.

14:09.390 --> 14:10.790
In this world,

14:11.020 --> 14:13.610
it is hard to distinguish between gratitude and resentment.

14:13.610 --> 14:15.410
It is hard to erase love and hate.

14:16.280 --> 14:18.390
All sincerity

14:18.800 --> 14:20.340
will be betrayed.

14:21.190 --> 14:22.410
Pei Siheng.

14:23.760 --> 14:27.010
The person who killed you is right in front of you.

14:31.400 --> 14:32.600
Take

14:34.080 --> 14:35.170
your revenge.

15:09.120 --> 15:11.510
You are indeed from a family of demon hunters.

15:11.510 --> 15:13.240
Your brother can't defeat you.

15:14.510 --> 15:15.940
Let me try.

15:30.230 --> 15:31.110
Zhi Mei.

15:33.030 --> 15:35.090
Zhi Mei is the most popular candidate

15:35.370 --> 15:37.900
for the top courtesan of Tianxiang Pavilion.

15:39.270 --> 15:41.880
You're well-informed, Mr. Zhuo.

15:42.290 --> 15:43.820
I just didn't expect it.

15:43.960 --> 15:46.280
You're so strict and orderly usually,

15:46.300 --> 15:48.900
but you actually have such refined interests.

15:51.550 --> 15:52.890
My refined interest

15:54.440 --> 15:56.060
is killing demons that yap.

16:00.900 --> 16:03.410
The annual courtesan selection of Tianxiang Pavilion

16:03.410 --> 16:04.540
has caused a stir in Tiandu.

16:04.540 --> 16:05.780
It's hard not to know.

16:12.150 --> 16:14.410
Zhi Mei was unpopular before.

16:14.970 --> 16:16.170
Now,

16:16.430 --> 16:18.890
she's overwhelming the other competitors.

16:19.790 --> 16:22.750
It means Cheng Huang has indeed fulfilled her wish.

16:23.280 --> 16:26.010
Cheng Huang controlled Zhi Mei's puppet to kill,

16:26.500 --> 16:28.290
setting up Cheng Huang's formation,

16:28.290 --> 16:29.940
and absorbing the power of life.

16:29.940 --> 16:32.360
Zhi Mei and the puppet are one.

16:32.850 --> 16:35.510
The puppet absorbed the vitality of the living.

16:35.930 --> 16:36.880
Zhi Mei

16:37.300 --> 16:39.830
naturally regained her youthful beauty too.

16:41.070 --> 16:43.360
If the murderer was Zhi Mei's puppet,

16:43.990 --> 16:47.000
why was it Pei Siheng at the crime scene?

16:47.630 --> 16:48.930
Or

16:50.010 --> 16:51.840
was the Pei Siheng here

16:52.270 --> 16:53.630
also a puppet?

16:59.630 --> 17:01.580
I saw plum blossom petals

17:01.790 --> 17:03.350
at the crime scene.

17:04.750 --> 17:06.480
Look at the plum blossom petals

17:06.560 --> 17:08.069
all over the stage.

17:09.569 --> 17:11.970
It means the killer was indeed

17:12.790 --> 17:14.790
Zhi Mei's puppet.

17:16.579 --> 17:18.069
Maybe Pei Siheng

17:19.390 --> 17:22.369
was only sent by Cheng Huang to save Zhi Mei's puppet.

17:55.900 --> 17:57.890
There are no plum trees in the yard.

17:59.910 --> 18:01.770
Where did these petals come from?

18:02.230 --> 18:03.830
The plates are still warm.

18:04.730 --> 18:05.940
That means

18:07.500 --> 18:09.290
the murderer is still here.

18:36.960 --> 18:38.940
Before, we didn't understand

18:39.470 --> 18:42.140
why Pei Siheng became a demon

18:42.620 --> 18:44.450
and why he came back to life.

18:44.760 --> 18:46.460
Now we understand.

18:46.680 --> 18:47.900
Pei Siheng

18:48.050 --> 18:50.460
must have made a wish to Cheng Huang too.

19:03.930 --> 19:05.360
You're indeed made of wood.

19:05.360 --> 19:06.600
Sister is in danger.

19:06.910 --> 19:08.260
Go save her!

19:22.150 --> 19:23.270
Sister Pei!

20:29.160 --> 20:30.500
Zhu Yan.

20:32.320 --> 20:33.230
Surprised?

20:34.100 --> 20:35.890
Old geezer.

20:36.390 --> 20:37.860
I'm quite surprised.

20:38.680 --> 20:39.940
I didn't expect

20:40.180 --> 20:42.440
you're still as impolite as before.

20:43.630 --> 20:45.260
I didn't expect

20:45.400 --> 20:47.650
you would have hooked up with Li Lun.

20:48.590 --> 20:50.790
I don't know what you're talking about.

20:50.910 --> 20:52.250
Is that sundial

20:52.790 --> 20:55.180
Li Lun's precious treasure?

20:56.960 --> 20:58.000
Yes.

20:59.460 --> 21:00.660
So what?

21:01.290 --> 21:03.290
Based on my understanding of Li Lun,

21:03.750 --> 21:06.070
he won't give it to you for no reason.

21:06.650 --> 21:07.720
Tell me.

21:08.600 --> 21:11.120
What shameful deal did you two make?

21:31.150 --> 21:33.800
Isn't the malicious energy on Zhao Yuanzhou

21:33.840 --> 21:35.350
enough?

21:38.270 --> 21:39.440
No.

21:55.200 --> 21:58.010
How do you know so much?

22:07.710 --> 22:08.960
Here.

22:10.160 --> 22:12.190
I keep my word.

22:35.870 --> 22:37.780
Since you know him so well,

22:38.830 --> 22:40.290
why don't you take a guess?

22:43.330 --> 22:45.350
To make you open the Kunlun Gate,

22:46.620 --> 22:47.660
right?

22:49.120 --> 22:50.600
Good guess.

22:50.720 --> 22:52.860
Only demons like me

22:52.890 --> 22:55.350
who have lived for tens of thousands of years

22:55.870 --> 22:57.290
can do it.

23:14.770 --> 23:15.520
Who is it?

23:22.710 --> 23:24.940
A friend from the Demon Hunting Bureau?

23:41.870 --> 23:44.390
I'll lend you the Truth Eye

23:46.630 --> 23:48.680
and let you remember

23:49.370 --> 23:51.330
what I look like.

23:56.240 --> 23:57.270
Who are you?

23:58.710 --> 24:00.980
Are you Ying Zhao's grandson?

24:01.610 --> 24:02.730
You know me?

24:03.390 --> 24:04.730
Of course.

24:06.030 --> 24:08.260
I was taken care of Ying Zhao before,

24:08.990 --> 24:10.850
so I don't want to hurt you.

24:11.800 --> 24:13.310
Get out of my way.

24:13.960 --> 24:15.690
Since I was asked to guard here,

24:16.380 --> 24:17.390
I won't let anyone

24:17.410 --> 24:18.650
inside.

24:24.420 --> 24:25.960
With just you?

25:16.540 --> 25:17.650
Cheng Huang.

25:18.500 --> 25:21.420
You're an old demon who's lived for tens of thousands of years.

25:21.420 --> 25:22.920
Instead of retiring,

25:22.940 --> 25:25.350
you came to the mortal world without permission

25:25.350 --> 25:26.750
and killed the innocent.

25:27.350 --> 25:28.680
Do you admit your crime?

25:30.600 --> 25:32.500
You have the power of the Qiankun,

25:32.890 --> 25:34.490
yet you killed the innocent.

25:35.200 --> 25:36.810
Do you admit your crime?

25:51.210 --> 25:52.490
You are…

25:54.240 --> 25:56.060
Baize Goddess?

25:58.920 --> 25:59.720
Yes.

26:00.990 --> 26:03.050
I'm here to capture you today.

26:03.310 --> 26:06.110
Return to the Demon Hunting Bureau to be punished.

26:09.210 --> 26:10.430
Evil?

26:11.590 --> 26:14.190
I'm helping them realize their wishes.

26:15.600 --> 26:17.490
You look for those with a wish

26:18.160 --> 26:19.910
and bewitch them,

26:20.120 --> 26:21.470
turning them into puppets.

26:21.470 --> 26:23.670
Then you manipulate the puppets to kill

26:23.790 --> 26:25.070
and absorb other people's lives

26:25.070 --> 26:26.320
to fulfill their wishes.

26:26.320 --> 26:28.250
If this isn't evil, then what is it?

26:29.490 --> 26:31.610
I can grant your wish.

26:31.760 --> 26:33.040
Are you willing?

26:32.750 --> 26:37.380
[Tavern]

28:43.300 --> 28:44.270
That's right.

28:46.560 --> 28:48.590
Actually, the one who was killing

28:49.500 --> 28:51.120
was not your brother,

28:52.120 --> 28:54.710
but the puppet I made.

29:07.280 --> 29:09.970
Kill this puppet and take revenge!

29:10.880 --> 29:12.810
You've always been cold-hearted.

29:13.030 --> 29:15.330
Let me see

29:15.680 --> 29:17.550
if you can

29:18.220 --> 29:19.850
do it now too.

29:40.160 --> 29:41.530
Sister Pei.

29:46.520 --> 29:48.230
I'm going to kill you

29:49.940 --> 29:51.650
to avenge my brother!

30:06.790 --> 30:09.250
Heng is my masterpiece.

30:09.710 --> 30:11.450
I was very satisfied,

30:12.230 --> 30:14.310
so I took him as my disciple.

30:15.200 --> 30:16.480
Unfortunately,

30:17.060 --> 30:19.370
Heng doesn't listen to me anymore.

30:20.900 --> 30:22.450
It's useless to keep him.

30:25.040 --> 30:27.040
But now it seems

30:28.310 --> 30:30.500
you still can't bear to kill him.

30:32.110 --> 30:33.160
How about

30:34.400 --> 30:35.550
I help you?

30:40.220 --> 30:41.300
Brother!

31:14.140 --> 31:17.140
Even the Original Goddess couldn't do anything to me.

31:17.350 --> 31:18.430
You,

31:19.010 --> 31:21.780
with only half of the Baize Token,

31:22.630 --> 31:24.760
think you can order me to stop?

31:26.500 --> 31:27.890
I'm old now.

31:28.490 --> 31:31.060
I feel tired when I move.

31:32.710 --> 31:33.900
I'm not in the mood

31:33.930 --> 31:36.560
to play with you kids anymore.

31:37.880 --> 31:40.550
Since you like staying in the sundial so much,

31:41.480 --> 31:43.250
you can stay

31:43.530 --> 31:45.520
until the end of the world.

32:00.470 --> 32:01.510
Heng.

32:09.280 --> 32:10.410
Before,

32:11.750 --> 32:13.350
I wondered countless times

32:15.910 --> 32:17.230
if you would cry

32:18.570 --> 32:20.600
for me when I died.

32:23.750 --> 32:25.130
Why wouldn't I?

32:27.940 --> 32:29.370
Of course I would.

32:35.280 --> 32:37.390
Because you are my brother.

32:38.120 --> 32:39.800
You've always been

32:41.590 --> 32:43.520
cold and distant since childhood.

32:44.950 --> 32:47.630
I never understood your emotions.

32:49.430 --> 32:50.590
When I was young,

32:52.150 --> 32:53.790
I got angry and said

32:56.200 --> 32:57.830
that even if I died,

33:00.150 --> 33:02.510
you wouldn't shed a single tear for me.

33:07.150 --> 33:08.270
But now,

33:11.440 --> 33:12.690
I realized

33:17.330 --> 33:19.320
I don't want you to cry at all.

33:24.790 --> 33:25.590
Sister.

33:28.040 --> 33:29.570
Don't cry.

33:31.950 --> 33:33.910
I don't deserve you to cry for me.

33:38.020 --> 33:39.010
Heng.

33:43.240 --> 33:45.330
I'm sorry.

33:46.590 --> 33:47.710
If...

33:50.200 --> 33:52.670
If I could let you finish back then...

33:52.690 --> 33:53.930
Back then,

33:54.040 --> 33:55.640
I only...

34:03.970 --> 34:05.230
Don't blame yourself.

34:06.720 --> 34:08.880
I didn't kill them,

34:09.750 --> 34:12.030
but I caused the disaster.

34:15.870 --> 34:16.790
It was me.

34:18.170 --> 34:21.030
I killed so many innocent people.

34:24.630 --> 34:26.909
You didn't do anything wrong.

34:32.960 --> 34:34.840
I just want you

34:38.790 --> 34:40.520
to forgive me.

34:42.900 --> 34:44.440
Don't blame me.

34:58.250 --> 34:59.050
Sister.

34:59.910 --> 35:01.150
After I die,

35:02.430 --> 35:04.630
♫I guard the eaves♫

35:02.550 --> 35:05.040
I won't be able to do anything for you anymore.

35:05.040 --> 35:07.090
♫And watch the times fade♫

35:08.010 --> 35:13.310
♫You hold the flame and watch the night♫

35:12.060 --> 35:13.100
Heng

35:13.600 --> 35:16.130
♫I count the winters♫

35:15.190 --> 35:17.550
What else can I do for you

35:16.390 --> 35:18.760
♫And waited for one more year♫

35:19.080 --> 35:24.070
♫My heart is full of passion♫

35:20.540 --> 35:21.570
Good

35:22.560 --> 35:23.610
Good.

35:24.110 --> 35:25.140
Live

35:24.720 --> 35:28.460
♫The stars dazzle and the crescent moon curves♫

35:25.830 --> 35:26.870
And

35:28.530 --> 35:29.740
♫The guilty greed♫

35:29.790 --> 35:33.300
♫Thousands of dark hairs, long and short♫

35:32.770 --> 35:33.810
Heng.

35:33.360 --> 35:35.560
♫The cruel entanglement♫

35:34.430 --> 35:36.430
Don't leave me.

35:36.100 --> 35:41.360
♫Lend me the cold lamp for one night♫

35:41.660 --> 35:46.740
♫Let regret stay before dawn♫

35:43.750 --> 35:44.670
Heng.

35:46.780 --> 35:49.230
♫Turns out I'm a wanderer♫

35:49.300 --> 35:52.100
♫And you're a song of reluctant parting♫

35:52.150 --> 35:55.250
♫In the sky of floating snowflakes♫

35:55.330 --> 35:57.890
♫You are the only warm bloom♫

35:57.940 --> 36:00.660
♫But why don't I remember♫

36:00.730 --> 36:03.430
♫How much the plot has twisted?♫

36:03.800 --> 36:05.330
♫I forgot the bitter karma♫

36:05.380 --> 36:08.270
♫I missed it again and again♫

36:08.300 --> 36:11.900
♫Helpless♫

36:12.030 --> 36:14.490
♫Turns out I'm a wanderer♫

36:14.550 --> 36:17.350
♫And you're a song of reluctant parting♫

36:17.410 --> 36:20.520
♫I'm a black-and-white wound♫

36:20.570 --> 36:23.090
♫You're the vibrant red color♫

36:23.180 --> 36:26.070
♫How can I not remember♫

36:26.120 --> 36:28.740
♫You're always by my side♫

36:28.800 --> 36:30.630
♫Like wind surrounding flowers♫

36:30.680 --> 36:38.310
♫Guarding the memories, never fading away♫

37:05.090 --> 37:06.990
Cheng Huang said we're going to stay here

37:06.990 --> 37:08.400
until the end of the world.

37:08.400 --> 37:09.260
Zhao Yuanzhou,

37:09.270 --> 37:10.270
what should we do?

37:10.780 --> 37:12.910
He's the one who controls the sundial.

37:13.200 --> 37:14.880
If he won't show up,

37:14.990 --> 37:16.450
it's indeed troublesome.

37:37.350 --> 37:38.890
Appear.

37:48.490 --> 37:49.930
I hope I can

37:49.960 --> 37:51.430
pass the imperial examination

37:51.430 --> 37:54.160
and become an official who pleads for the people.

37:55.880 --> 37:57.240
I hope I can find my true love

37:57.240 --> 37:58.810
and be together forever.

38:02.220 --> 38:03.810
If I can give birth to my child,

38:03.810 --> 38:05.590
I will repay you for my wish.

38:23.070 --> 38:25.540
It's a normal puppet without memories.

38:26.660 --> 38:27.870
This puppet...

38:29.140 --> 38:29.940
What?

38:34.980 --> 38:36.260
I've seen her

38:36.290 --> 38:39.220
in the album of past goddesses that my master gave me.

38:40.070 --> 38:41.730
She was the Original Goddess.

38:43.360 --> 38:44.850
The Original Goddess?

38:48.170 --> 38:49.200
You didn't know?

38:49.470 --> 38:50.480
Just now,

38:50.500 --> 38:51.980
Cheng Huang mentioned it.

38:52.830 --> 38:54.000
I'm so young.

38:54.020 --> 38:55.340
How would I know?

38:57.230 --> 38:59.030
I didn't exist

38:59.030 --> 39:01.090
when the Original Goddess appeared.

39:01.110 --> 39:03.140
Only an old monster like Cheng Huang

39:03.190 --> 39:05.250
would have met the Original Goddess.

39:07.070 --> 39:10.600
Then why does Cheng Huang have a puppet of the Original Goddess?

39:10.670 --> 39:11.670
Could it be

39:11.910 --> 39:14.110
she also had a wish that she couldn't tell

39:14.110 --> 39:15.840
and was cheated by Cheng Huang?

39:17.790 --> 39:19.350
The goddess's wish

39:19.840 --> 39:21.400
was peace between the two realms,

39:21.400 --> 39:23.070
for kindness and evil to have consequences,

39:23.070 --> 39:25.500
and for bad demons like Cheng Huang to be punished.

39:25.500 --> 39:27.230
How could she be cheated by him?

39:29.760 --> 39:30.810
But

39:31.780 --> 39:33.230
it's evident

39:33.660 --> 39:35.430
that Cheng Huang treated this puppet

39:35.430 --> 39:36.490
very differently.

39:36.770 --> 39:38.890
The paint on it was retouched

39:38.910 --> 39:40.110
after it faded.

39:40.360 --> 39:41.730
It's exquisite.

39:44.840 --> 39:45.680
Hmm...

39:46.660 --> 39:48.040
I got it.

39:49.130 --> 39:51.410
Let's use this puppet as a hostage.

39:56.320 --> 39:57.790
Old thing,

39:57.820 --> 39:59.350
I'll count down from three.

39:59.390 --> 40:00.830
If you don't come out,

40:00.860 --> 40:02.730
I'll destroy this puppet

40:02.750 --> 40:04.640
and twist off her head.

40:06.290 --> 40:07.080
Three.

40:08.670 --> 40:09.500
Two.

40:12.380 --> 40:13.170
One.

40:30.190 --> 40:31.390
If you don't come out,

40:33.510 --> 40:35.150
I'll kiss her.

40:35.900 --> 40:36.810
Ridiculous.

40:37.510 --> 40:38.540
This is an emergency.

40:38.540 --> 40:39.920
It calls for desperate tactics.

40:39.920 --> 40:41.350
This tactic is too desperate.

40:41.350 --> 40:43.150
The desperateness is too tacky.

40:44.950 --> 40:46.610
Are you really not coming out?

41:09.080 --> 41:10.520
You bastard!

41:19.320 --> 41:20.500
Give it back!

41:21.770 --> 41:24.210
Otherwise, none of you can get out.

41:26.070 --> 41:27.150
Well,

41:27.590 --> 41:29.520
I'm not in a hurry to go out.

41:29.960 --> 41:32.030
I just want to hear some legendary gossip.

41:32.030 --> 41:33.640
What's your relationship

41:33.750 --> 41:35.650
with the Original Goddess?

41:36.790 --> 41:39.000
How could a heartless demon

41:39.150 --> 41:41.190
have anything to do with the goddess?

41:41.190 --> 41:42.310
Why not?

41:42.480 --> 41:44.890
Didn't the cruelest demon in the world

41:45.330 --> 41:47.950
also call Zhao Wan'er his sister?

41:48.320 --> 41:50.540
How can you compare with me?

41:50.910 --> 41:53.540
Wan'er and I were really like siblings.

41:53.570 --> 41:54.440
But you...

41:58.800 --> 42:01.200
You secretly painted the goddess's puppet

42:02.550 --> 42:04.860
but cut back on the fabric,

42:05.250 --> 42:06.480
making her seem a bit frivolous.

42:06.480 --> 42:07.290
Shut up!

42:08.200 --> 42:09.340
I'll kill you!

42:11.120 --> 42:11.920
Stop!

42:14.020 --> 42:15.720
Shut up or stop?

42:16.660 --> 42:17.950
Zhu Yan.

42:31.790 --> 42:32.850
Brother Zhuo!

42:34.500 --> 42:35.420
Brother Zhuo.

42:36.990 --> 42:39.020
We came out of the illusion.

42:45.130 --> 42:46.210
I don't think so.

42:47.650 --> 42:48.510
Zhao Yuanzhou,

42:48.880 --> 42:49.870
where are we?

42:50.590 --> 42:52.320
This mountain and stone

42:52.510 --> 42:55.230
is the way from the Wilderness to the Kunlun Gate.

42:55.230 --> 42:57.030
But this is not the Wilderness.

42:57.440 --> 42:59.630
It's just a replica of the Wilderness.

43:00.920 --> 43:03.140
We're still in Cheng Huang's illusion.

43:06.600 --> 43:08.120
Why did you

43:08.880 --> 43:10.010
invite us here?

43:10.040 --> 43:11.770
Didn't you want to know

43:11.790 --> 43:13.580
about the Original Goddess?

43:13.820 --> 43:14.670
No one wants to know

43:14.670 --> 43:16.910
about your stupid love life.

43:17.350 --> 43:18.230
Hurry up and—

43:18.250 --> 43:19.170
I want to know.

43:30.390 --> 43:32.110
The original Baize Token

43:32.260 --> 43:33.920
was divided into two.

43:33.940 --> 43:35.540
The Original Goddess

43:35.560 --> 43:38.200
and the strongest Great Demon of the Wilderness

43:38.200 --> 43:39.750
managed it together.

43:48.440 --> 43:50.370
After the ancient flood,

43:50.410 --> 43:52.220
the gods fell.

43:52.240 --> 43:53.600
The human and demon worlds

43:53.600 --> 43:54.950
fell into chaos.

43:54.980 --> 43:57.260
I was ordered by White Emperor Shaohao

43:57.390 --> 43:59.430
to rule the demons in the Wilderness

43:59.550 --> 44:01.330
and protect all beings.

44:05.020 --> 44:07.030
But as destined by fate,

44:07.490 --> 44:09.590
I, Baize, am a celestial beast

44:09.760 --> 44:12.100
and am immortal,

44:12.360 --> 44:14.170
but I’m willing to sacrifice myself

44:14.170 --> 44:16.090
and transform into the power of Baize

44:16.090 --> 44:18.160
to be passed on in the world.

44:24.720 --> 44:26.110
Each generation, I will choose

44:26.110 --> 44:28.340
the purest human

44:28.480 --> 44:30.550
to control all demons.

45:10.710 --> 45:12.230
Bless everything.

45:12.250 --> 45:13.830
Invulnerable to all evil.

45:14.110 --> 45:15.800
We promise to work together

45:17.050 --> 45:18.840
and guard the Wilderness.

45:18.880 --> 45:20.650
And guard the Wilderness.
